            <sparkle:version>130</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.37</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Say Halo 0.8.37

- Empty dictations are no longer kept when "save history" is off, and Delete All now removes them too.
- Your shortcut key works in more situations, including before Accessibility is turned on.
]]></description>
