            <link>https://github.com/agent-tg/say-halo/releases/latest</link>
            <sparkle:version>129</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.36</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Say Halo 0.8.36

- Your shortcut key now keeps working while another app has secure keyboard entry on, such as a password field in your browser. Before, the key did nothing until you clicked out of that field.
]]></description>
